  "body": "### Summary\n\nCapture on the Mac, with the LOT-001 kit (`tooling/fixtures/`), how HFR answers a cookie-less GET of a topic in a member-only forum.\n\n### Scope\n\nRead-only. Offline saves (LOT-139, #229) fetch every page without cookies, so a logged-in member saving such a topic gets that answer. The behaviour fails closed today; the message is generic.\n\n### Wanted by\n\nLOT-139 (#229)\n\n### Depends on\n\n—",
